prebsd NEWS
==========

0.2 (2026-08-27)
  * JSON manifest (images.json) with per-image provenance, mount commands and
    sha256 checksums; fetch skips or re-downloads by checksum and keeps a
    mismatched file for investigation.
  * fetch supports V4 (aap tape recovery), V5 (TUHS Dennis_v5), and the 32V
    and Keith Bostic V7 tapes.

0.1 (2026-08-26)
  * Initial release: fetch V6/V7 disk images, per-image simh configs, and a
    headless console driver (boot.py).
